# Required substrings in the final frame of data-table.tape.
# `cargo xtask record e2e --check` fails if any is missing — i.e. a real
# terminal failed to deliver the keys, or the sort/edit/commit/filter
# pipeline (DataTableState + project() + the borrowed TextEdit write-back)
# did not reach the rendered frame end to end.
#
# The exact assembled state after the scripted key sequence:
STATE sort=0:asc filter=o group=none sel=1 edit=none commit=2,1=lead rows=2
# The committed in-cell edit was written back into the data and rendered:
lead
# Sanity: the fixture's own title line rendered.
rstui data-table e2e
